WEBVTT

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.830
This class system places a curse upon people.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:29.620
Because of it, people's hearts are tainted
and twisted, giving rise to devils.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.540
In which case, the opposite is also true.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.750
Once the devils are cast out,
people's hearts become clear again,

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.450
and the curse is lifted.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.200
The country will assuredly be beautiful.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:57.580
You are a nobleman; wouldn't you
like to see something like that?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:07.000
An orphan... with the knowledge
to leave adults speechless?

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.290
At first, I simply regarded him
as being unusual. That was all.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.250
The thing that triggered my interest in him...

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.500
...was really only that.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.910
Come live with me.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:35.950
<i>The mist is hiding the sin</i>

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.700
<i>I hold in my hand the LIST of judgment</i>

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.330
<i>I'm gonna do the perfect crime</i>
<i>and bury them in a cist</i>

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:46.580
<i>That's my DYING WISH for you</i>
<i>(Set a thief to catch another thief)</i>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:52.000
<i>Guys of the privileged class torment the weak</i>
<i>(Set a thief to catch another thief)</i>

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.080
<i>And they enjoy it</i>

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:00.660
<i>That's a bloody world, an endlessly</i>
<i>discriminatory society (dystopia)</i>

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:05.660
<i>Happiness does not bloom here</i>
<i>(Set a thief to catch another thief)</i>

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.790
<i>We are oppressed</i>

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:14.370
<i>We must do something. Come on</i>

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:20.830
<i>Let the end begin</i>

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:26.660
<i>Break it to relieve your soul</i>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:32.580
<i>Open your eyes. You'll be reborn</i>
<i>when you lose your life</i>

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:37.700
<i>Lord of crime hora yume no ikenie</i>
<i>We're lords of crime. We're sacrifice for ideals</i>

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:49.950
<i>Freedom lives forever, even if we die</i>

00:02:55.870 --> 00:03:00.790
"The Scarlet Eyes Act 2"

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:27.540
Welcome home, Mr Albert.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.330
Hey, hold it.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.370
You two go around the back.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:38.700
If you go in here with those shoes,
you will make the foyer filthy.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.120
Simon!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.830
As of today, they are members
of the Moriarty household.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.370
You will cease treating them so rudely.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.950
What is the meaning of this, Darling?!

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:59.830
I told you, we are taking in an orphan.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:03.370
Yes, but no one said anything about <i>two </i>of them!

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.370
That was Albert's decision.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:09.160
But I heard that the younger one is sick!

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.580
I sure don't want to catch whatever he has.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.330
Orphans are all filthy,
and filled with diseases.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:18.830
That's right, Darling! If anything
happens to one of my children...

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.830
Not another word! My decision is final.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.870
That is splendid news, Lord Moriarty!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.200
You have taken on two orphans!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.790
Ha, I did give you my word, after all.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:43.750
It is the duty of those of us who have
to extend a hand to those who have not.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:48.080
Further, you will be providing the sickly
younger brother with an operation, as well?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.540
From what the doctor says,
it must be done right away.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:56.250
He has had such a hard life
up to this point, after all.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:05:01.950
However, he will get his operation forthwith,
in hopes that he will regain his strength.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.660
Louis!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.080
Louis, I'll go get someone, right now!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:33.080
Please wait, Brother...

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:38.750
I'm... all right...
It's just my usual... episode.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.080
Give it a few moments...

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:45.450
I'd rather... you stayed here.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.120
Ah, you there!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.870
Would you make me some tea?

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:09.870
Y-Yes, as you wish.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:21.910
Um, here you go.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.620
So tell me...

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:50.410
Did you seriously think that I would drink tea
made by a person of <i>your </i>standing?

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:54.660
Aw, and now, because of you,
the carpet has been stained.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:59.080
Clean up this mess. Using your tongue.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.620
I will clean the mess up.

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.040
Brother...

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:17.370
Hmm, so the older brother answers
for the younger one's carelessness.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.410
Such touching brotherly love.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:26.080
So then lower life forms such as yourselves
experience those feelings, too.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:31.250
However, if you are truly going to answer
for him, I should like you to discipline him,

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.660
ensuring he does not commit
the same mishap again.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:39.750
I make it a rule to teach those
of lower class the hard way.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.870
Use <i>this </i>to physically engrave the lesson.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.660
Did that make you feel better?

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.790
I'm sorry.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:30.000
This happened because I was not around.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.870
Please do not let it concern you.
You did not do anything wrong, my lord.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:41.700
But never mind me. His lordship
will find you if you stay here.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.160
Please move along, now.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.580
Louis...

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.540
Brother...

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:09.870
Why did Lord Moriarty invite us to his manor?

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:12.910
Was it out of aristocratic obligation?

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:16.370
Was it out of sympathy for my illness?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:20.540
He has indeed helped us.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:27.200
So exactly what sort of just desserts
can he receive from us?

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:30.540
All people use others, no matter who they are.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:35.830
That's what mutual aid is.
I don't think it's such a bad thing.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:41.200
Actually, we are taking advantage
of his offer, as well.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:50.250
Let's wait a little while longer,
to see what he seeks of us.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:55.000
Although... I can rather surmise
what it is already.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:10.750
William, your enrolment at Eton College
is coming up before too long.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.500
You need to commit to your
studies more than you are.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:16.830
I can't concentrate.

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:20.910
Not when you're raising those two
lower creatures under the same roof.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:24.830
There's no telling what they might
do to me if I lower my guard.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:31.750
My Darling, this has gone on long enough.
Let's run those two off already.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:36.790
The younger appears to have gotten
over his illness. No one will fuss.

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:41.160
Don't make it sound so simple.
Dismiss the orphans we took in?

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:45.410
I will be the one who takes the brunt of it.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.620
If they would only become
a bother to the police,

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.950
that would give us a reason to chase them out.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.540
Incidentally, William...

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.790
Yesterday, as I was stepping out
of my carriage in town,

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.870
one of the peddler men offered me his thanks.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.660
Did you do some sort of good deed?

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.540
What do you mean?
They must have had the wrong person.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.370
I would not be speaking to some common peddler.

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:18.750
I mean, those people are like sewer rats.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.500
They're dingy, and smelly.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.330
Hmm. You're right about that.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:29.080
That's quite enough of that, both of you.
We are eating, and you're being foul.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.910
Never mind about them.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:35.540
My birthday next month is the same day
as Easter, and I want to throw a huge party.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.540
I can invite a great deal of people, right?

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.620
None of those children
from Baron Kimble's family.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.620
I'm told that they are having
substantial financial trouble.

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:46.660
I won't invite Tom. They're only life peers.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.910
Make certain that the son of
the Marquess of Lytton attends.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:12:00.370
Is something the matter, Albert?
You have been acting strange of late.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:03.910
<i>You're </i>the ones who are strange.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.000
See here, Albert!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.450
I don't want to talk to you.
I don't want to hear your voices.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.700
I don't want to look at your faces.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:16.330
You lot are befouling this
family--this whole world.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:24.290
There's nought... that I can do.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:34.120
For as long as I can remember, it's been so.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:39.370
Everywhere I looked,
it was status, status, status.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:44.790
People looking up at others in envy,
and down on others in scorn.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.950
Why is this family...?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:56.200
Why is this whole world so precisely twisted?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.830
What would you do?

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:05.080
When all that stand before you
are those who besmirch the world?

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:16.330
Is that the recompense you seek from me?

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:11.080
How convenient.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.540
Y-You're supposed to be asleep!

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:25.450
This saves me the trouble of
having to move your body later.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.250
My body? What are you talking about?

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.200
I see.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.910
You thought that by hiding those
in our room, and finding them later,

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:39.120
you would be able to frame us
as thieves, and have us thrown out.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.160
A-Are you... going to kill me...

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.080
...with that?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.910
No. The person who will deal with you...

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:08.910
B--

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.580
Brother?

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:22.790
Can you... kill others in
the cause of your ideals?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:29.250
Is that the recompense you seek from me?

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:35.950
Yes. Right now, I need the wisdom
and courage to achieve my ideals.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:41.200
I will give you my wisdom.
I am a consultant, after all.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.700
However, the courage must come...

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.120
...from yourself.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.450
Wh-What do you mean to do, Brother!?

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.540
No, what do <i>you </i>mean to do?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.620
Y-You don't really mean it, do you, Brother?

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:05.790
Remember, we're family!
We share the same blood, so this is--

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.120
Stop!

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:10.950
Just thinking that the same filthy blood
that you have flows through me...

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.950
...is enough to make me want to vomit.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:20.040
I hold you... this family...
and this whole society in contempt!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.160
I'm going to change it.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.700
Starting today.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:29.580
I do not need any people like you in my world!

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.620
You have now shown me...

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.500
...the proof of your resolve.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:08.040
If you pull that out, you will lose
a great deal of blood and die.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:13.330
We need you to still draw breath
for a little while longer.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:16.750
In the unlikely event that there is
a coroner's inquest on your body,

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:22.000
I would prefer that your lungs be found inflamed
by the inhalation of searing hot smoke.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.410
What are... you...?

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:31.200
Come, let's set about finishing this affair.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:37.580
What matters most is not leading anyone
to think that there is a case here.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.500
We stage it to look like an accident,

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.750
and dispose of anything
that might serve as evidence.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:48.750
By doing so... this will become a perfect crime.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:53.950
Burning any trace of evidence
should serve to do away with it.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:18:01.790
Gas is well suited for ensuring that a fire
spreads swiftly throughout a manor of this size.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.830
Perhaps because of their prevalence,

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:09.450
fires due to gas leaks do break out
here in London from time to time.

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.330
Thus, there is an extremely high probability

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:15.870
that it will be ruled as an unfortunate,
but common, accident.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:23.870
It is fairly airtight in here,
so it's unlikely that the gas will enter.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:30.330
Now, we simply wait in here
for the manor to fill with gas.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.950
Let's go. It's coming down.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.410
Louis?

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.040
Louis!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.370
What are you doing!?

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:38.080
It's better to do this to approach
100% of the outcome you want.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:41.370
Adults won't doubt the word of children
who are not only burnt out of their home,

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.040
but injured, as well.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.870
I won't let them.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:49.000
Moreover, this is my recompense
to the two of you.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:52.290
You two, who saved me from my illness.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:57.330
As well as proof of my resolve that
the three of us will go on living together.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:03.950
As accomplices, as comrades, and as family.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:08.330
This is how we're going to live.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:11.580
Once the devils are cast out,
people's hearts become clear again,

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.950
and the curse is lifted.

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:17.750
The country will assuredly be beautiful.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.370
Come live with me.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:28.500
I'll take the brain that you possess
and add to it the authority that I have.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:33.120
I'll give you my standing,
my fortune, and my life.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.660
I'll give you everything your ambitions demand.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:44.580
I want you to show me...
the world as idealised by you.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:04.200
A-Are you all right?!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.120
Doctor! Quickly!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.700
Who are you?

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.910
Albert.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.790
Albert James Moriarty.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:20.000
And these are my brothers, William and Louis.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.830
After the fire, we had no
other relatives to turn to,

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:32.750
so the three of us each leant on each other
and somehow managed to get on with our lives.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.000
That sounds quite dreadful.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:38.250
Forgive me for dredging up
any unpleasant memories.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:42.620
Still, it sounds like you had
a truly warm household.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:49.000
A stately father and warm-hearted mother,
as well as brothers that get along.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:52.660
A veritable picture-perfect, ideal family.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.200
Yes...

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:58.160
Indeed so.

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:11.250
<i>An oath committed by souls assumed,</i>

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:15.450
<i>with ideals that wallow in genetic karma</i>

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:34.540
<i>Lie! Be resolute if you're going</i>
<i>to share your pain</i>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>(Demonstrate your resolve)</i>

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:40.290
<i>Like, dislike, you can't afford</i>
<i>to care either way</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>It depends on the objective</i>
<i>(Making it happen is what's most important)</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.040
<i>The necessary evil of self-sacrifice</i>

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:50.660
<i>is a righteous cause that no one can comprehend</i>

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:54.410
<i>Take pride in the inviolable bonds shared</i>

00:22:54.410 --> 00:22:59.250
<i>among brothers who bear the same crime</i>

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:02.910
<i>Make a chance trigger your inevitable stance</i>

00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:04.580
<i>and get drunk on your accomplishments</i>

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:06.370
<i>at the end</i>

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>Don't believe in what you can see,</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:13.790
<i>in truths there's no point in knowing</i>
<i>(Whatever it takes)</i>

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:20.370
<i>Defer to its own validity,</i>
<i>you only have one goal</i>

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:21.870
<i>(Let me hear you say)</i>

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:28.700
<i>You can't lie to yourself, come along with me</i>

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:34.370
<i>It's all because there is no answer</i>

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:36.750
<i>There is no turning back</i>

00:23:46.410 --> 00:23:51.200
Next time on <i>Moriarty the Patriot</i>:
"A Rare Breed."
